# Flattens the nested single-file surfaces (Bar/Bar.qml, Launcher/Launcher.qml,
# Lock/Lock.qml, Settings/Settings.qml) so shell.qml can reach them as
# Components.Bar etc. instead of Components.Bar.Bar. The rest of this
# directory's files sit directly in Components/ and need no entry.

Bar 1.0 Bar/Bar.qml
Launcher 1.0 Launcher/Launcher.qml
Lock 1.0 Lock/Lock.qml
Settings 1.0 Settings/Settings.qml
Cheatsheet 1.0 Cheatsheet.qml
Toast 1.0 Toast.qml
Osd 1.0 Osd.qml
ImageViewer 1.0 ImageViewer.qml
Background 1.0 Background.qml
Overview 1.0 Overview.qml
ImageWindow 1.0 ImageWindow.qml